{"unit_id":"wuaisaber__dsh-think-zh-plus#feature-1","repo":"wuaisaber/dsh-think-zh-plus","commit":"6cc404635fef01a3f95b7261d1af407943c0c101","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-think-zh-plus 的功能「中文推理规则」：向 system prompt 注册一段语言要求，默认让内部推理使用简体中文，并保留代码、命令、路径和报错原文。插件加载时自动生效，也可配置目标语言和作用范围。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:109-124","index.js:145-156"]}
{"unit_id":"wuaisaber__dsh-think-zh-plus#feature-2","repo":"wuaisaber/dsh-think-zh-plus","commit":"6cc404635fef01a3f95b7261d1af407943c0c101","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-think-zh-plus 的功能「Think 行自动展开」：客户端扫描对话中的折叠 Think 行并点击其 disclosure 控件，DOM 后续变化时也会再次扫描。用户手动操作过的行会退出自动展开。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:75-105","client.js:107-144"]}
{"unit_id":"wuaisaber__dsh-think-zh-plus#feature-3","repo":"wuaisaber/dsh-think-zh-plus","commit":"6cc404635fef01a3f95b7261d1af407943c0c101","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-think-zh-plus 的功能「规则自定义」：可设置语言、只约束思考或同时约束思考和最终回复，并可用自定义 instruction 完整覆盖默认文案；enabled 可关闭该 system prompt 段落。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:45-52","index.js:109-137"]}
{"unit_id":"wuaisaber__dsh-think-zh-plus#feature-4","repo":"wuaisaber/dsh-think-zh-plus","commit":"6cc404635fef01a3f95b7261d1af407943c0c101","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-think-zh-plus 的功能「思考区域区分样式」：展开的 Think 区块会注入左侧细线和间距样式，使其与最终回复在视觉上区分。客户端启动时添加样式，已有同插件样式时不会重复插入。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:53-69"]}
{"unit_id":"wuaisaber__dsh-think-zh-plus#caveat-1","repo":"wuaisaber/dsh-think-zh-plus","commit":"6cc404635fef01a3f95b7261d1af407943c0c101","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-think-zh-plus 使用特定的 Think 行 DOM 属性和 ModuleLoader 接口；DSH UI 结构变化时，客户端自动展开可能需要随之更新。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:9-13","client.js:31-43"]}
